### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = lucassotovargas@gmail.com
@password = hola123

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Registrar un nuevo usuario (Crear Cuenta)
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "role": "student"
}

### 3. Iniciar sesión (Login)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Guardar Token de la respuesta
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}
@userId = {{login.response.body.user.id}}

### 4. Obtener todos los usuarios (Ver usuarios)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Obtener un usuario por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Actualizar un usuario (Modificar)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "updateduser@example.com",
  "role": "teacher"
}

### 7. Eliminar un usuario (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json


